    "summary": "Three weeks chasing the hour when cloud lies down in the valleys and the peaks come out above it.",
    "story": "<p>The forecast I look for is the one everybody else cancels on: rain overnight, clearing by dawn. Cloud pools on the water, then lifts a little at a time, and for about twenty minutes the mountains look like they're being made.</p><p>Nothing here took long to shoot. All of it took a long time to wait for.</p>",
